  ($q$RW-031$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Information and Ideas$q$, $q$Inferences$q$, 3, $q$The startup's founders publicly credit 'relentless customer feedback' for every major product decision, though internal emails obtained by a reporter show the flagship feature was greenlit after a single conversation with an investor, months before any customer had used the product.

