  ($q$RW-032$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Information and Ideas$q$, $q$Central Ideas and Details$q$, 2, $q$Long dismissed as a niche hobby, competitive chess has seen a surge in youth participation since online platforms made it possible to play thousands of opponents without leaving home. Coaches report that the accessibility, more than any single champion's fame, has driven the growth.

