  ($q$RW-040$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Words in Context$q$, 2, $q$The professor's lecture style was famously ______; she wove in personal anecdotes, historical tangents, and pop-culture references until the fifty-minute class felt like ten.

